This product includes software developed as part of jev-pipeline-skill (MIT).

The DeepSeek Harness plugin adapter structure (Cordis plugin exports, defineTool
tool declarations, dsh manifest and cordis.patch.yml bundle pattern) follows the
publicly documented pattern of jevcore-dsh:
  PerryLink/jevcore — packages/dsh — Apache-2.0 — https://github.com/PerryLink/jevcore
No source code from that project is included here; the three tools in this
package shell out to the local jev_pipeline CLI instead.

The pipeline itself orchestrates these upstream tools by reference (never copied):
  VBS2004/jev-questions-skill (MIT) — lint, spread, threshold, coverage
  abhisheksharma001/jev-skill (MIT) — find_decision_calls, fit_check
